CLGaugeCollectFeesConcreteUnitTest
├── When the caller is not the voting rewards manager
│   └── It should revert with {NVRM}
├── When the gauge has no corresponding pool
│   ├── It should return zero amounts
│   └── It should not transfer tokens
├── When the gauge is not activated
│   ├── It should return zero amounts
│   └── It should not transfer tokens
├── When the emission cap is zero
│   ├── It should return zero amounts
│   └── It should not transfer tokens
├── When no fees are claimable
│   ├── It should return zero amounts
│   └── It should not transfer tokens
└── When fees are pending
    ├── It should transfer fees directly to the voting rewards manager
    ├── It should emit a {ClaimFees} event
    └── It should return the claimed amounts
